# Push finished work to GitHub

When a change in this repository is finished, commit it and push it to `origin` on `main` without waiting for another request.

- Use the repository commit style: one or two sentences on why.
- Do not commit secrets, local preview data, or `.local/`.
- Do not force-push, skip hooks, or change git config.
- After the image build finishes, say that Unraid can Force Update.
